            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>The present invention relates to sports balls. A sports ball comprises a surface layer (45) comprising a plurality of panels (46). The sports ball further comprises a lattice structure (100; 20; 300; 40; 50; 60; 70; 1100) extending below the surface layer (45), wherein the lattice structure (100; 200; 300; 40; 50, 60; 70; 1100) comprises a plurality of lattice cells comprising radially extending elements (130; 230; 330; 630; 730; 1130). The lattice cells which are adjacent to the surface layer (45) have at least one dimension which is smaller than an average diameter of the panels (46).</p>
            </abstract>
